            <note corresp="#d234-f2" n="2" xml:id="d234-f2-content">
                <p>Starting January 1978, Junior Officers are appointed as Career Candidates—FSR. [Footnote is in the original.]</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d234-f3" n="3" xml:id="d234-f3-content">
                <p>An additional 73 women Mid and Junior level FSO
                    Career Candidates have been taken in since 1/1/80 for a total FSO and Career Candidate population of 486 women
                    (less attrition) by 10/1/80. This represents 12.7% of a total 3,830. [Footnote
                    is in the original.]</p>
            </note>
